# Secrets. `.env.example` is the only one that belongs in the repo — everything
# else here names live credentials, and `vite.config.ts` inlines GEMINI_API_KEY
# straight into the client bundle, so a committed .env leaks twice over.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.claude/
